<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002O_S0008" variety="S0008">
<name>Engine Immobiliser</name>
<ttl id="1002O_S0008_741KM_T000P" variety="T000P">
<name>Engine Immobiliser System</name>
<para id="RM000000MGF00UX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="580LY-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000000MGF00UX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A4000000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000MGG00TX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Crank the engine for 10 seconds or more</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>CAN Communication System Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), display the [Diagnosis/CAN Bus Diagnosis/CAN Bus Connected ECU Check] screen and check all ECUs and sensors connected to CAN communication.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.82in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>CAN communication normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>CAN communication malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication System (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] Communication Function</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform a communication function inspection of the large-scale body multiplex communication system and check that there is no malfunction in the communication system.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.82in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001Z23006X"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC of EFI System</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs of the EFI system. (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.81in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.32in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No codes other than B2799 are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Codes other than B2799 are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If [No codes other than B2799 are output], perform step 7 onward and then perform the B2799 flow.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to EFI System (see <xref label="Seep03" href="X39400000QQ017D"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC of Engine Immobiliser System (Certification ECU)</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check for DTCs (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000000MGH00TX"/>) and record them.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep11" href="RM000000MGS00TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded codes, reproduce the malfunction symptom and check whether the same DTCs are output again. (see <xref label="Seep12" href="RM000000MGS00TX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.44in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.69in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Codes B2781, B2782, B2786 or B2788 are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Codes other than B2781, B2782, B2786 and B2788 are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Steering Lock System (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000005FQ00UX"/>) or Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] (see <xref label="Seep10" href="RM000001Z23006X"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to troubleshooting for each output code (see <xref label="Seep13" href="RM000000MGH00TX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000000MGT00TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000MGJ00TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>